subaki Sawabe and Ryouta Watari. While struggling to get over his mother's death, he continues to cling to music. His monochrome life turns upside down the day he encounters the eccentric violinist Kaori Miyazono, who thrusts him back into the spotlight as her accompanist. Through a little lie, these two young musicians grow closer together as Kaori tries to fill Kousei's world with color.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Classical Music","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":92,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":87,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":78,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shounen","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":69,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":47,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ancient China","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":33,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Your lie in April","english":"Your lie in April","native":"四月は君の嘘","romaji":"Shigatsu wa Kimi no Uso","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"四月是你的谎言"}]},"trailer":{"id":"3aL0gDZtFbE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3aL0gDZtFbE/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}